  "instruction": "Is Palindrome",
  "output": "    public boolean isPalindrome(int x) {\n        int temp = x;\n        int rev = 0;\n        int last;\n        if(x<0){\n            return false;\n        }\n        while(temp >0){\n            last = temp%10;\n            rev = (rev*10)+last;\n            temp = temp/10;\n        }\n        return rev == x;\n    }",
